/T (After the cleaning process, financial analysis was performed using Excel formulas such as SUM, AVERAGE, IF, SUMIF, COUNTIF, and VLOOKUP along with Pivot Tables for department-wise salary analysis and payroll expense calculation. Various charts and dashboards were created to visualize employee salary distribution, bonus analysis, tax deductions, and department-wise payroll expenses.)
/E (After the cleaning process, financial analysis was performed using Excel formulas such as SUM, AVERAGE, IF, SUMIF, COUNTIF, and VLOOKUP along with Pivot Tables for department-wise salary analysis and payroll expense calculation. Various charts and dashboards were created to visualize employee salary distribution, bonus analysis, tax deductions, and department-wise payroll expenses.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
