/T (Organizations generate large amounts of payroll data related to employee salaries, bonuses, tax deductions, and payment records. However, payroll datasets often contain inconsistencies such as missing values, duplicate records, incorrect salary calculations, invalid tax entries, and inconsistent date formats. These issues reduce data accuracy and make payroll management difficult.)
/E (Organizations generate large amounts of payroll data related to employee salaries, bonuses, tax deductions, and payment records. However, payroll datasets often contain inconsistencies such as missing values, duplicate records, incorrect salary calculations, invalid tax entries, and inconsistent date formats. These issues reduce data accuracy and make payroll management difficult.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
